    "Name": "Bolt Charge",
    "Description": "Damage instances scored within 3 seconds of each while Bolt Charge is active increments a Magazine-capacity based counter towards gaining a stack of Bolt Charge.\nGrants 2.5% Melee Ability Energy per Bolt Charge stack obtained, up to 25% Melee Ability Energy over the 10 stacks needed to discharge.\nSwapping weapons resets the counter. Gaining a stack through damage prevents simultaneous damage instances from incrementing the counter.\nAcquiring over x10 stacks through abilities will still grant the corresponding Ability Gains (For example, being at x9 and acquiring x4 will still grant 10% Melee Energy)\n\nDamage instances needed to gain a stack:\n(15% of Magazine, rounded down) + 2\nArea-Denial GLs: 3 or 4?\nSwords: 2\n3-Ammo Snipers: 1\nGlaive Melee, as well as Damage-over-Time sources all count.\n\nAfter 0.5 seconds of scoring an Ability Hit or dealing Unpowered Melee Damage while at x10 Bolt Charge stacks:\nDischarges an Arc Bolt over the damaged enemy, dealing up to 405 Bolt Splash + 270 Floor Splash = 675 Total [36 Bolt Splash + 30 Floor Splash] Arc Damage over ? meters.\n\nTriggers Discharge:\nVolatile Explosions | Freeze Shatter (Not auto-shatter on Bosses) | Tangle Explosions | Threadlings | Unraveling Threads | Suspend Snap on Bosses | Forerunner's The Rock\n\nDo NOT trigger Discharge:\n Jolt's Chain Lightning | Scorch and Ignitions (from Non-Abilities) | Crystal Shatter (from Non-Abilities) | Glaive Melee | Gifted Conviction's Explosives",
